<meta name="description" content="The FASTTM education program is based on funding provided by DHS S&amp;T to the National Center for Disaster Medicine and Public Health (NCDMPH). The FASTTM course and digital materials, developed by the American Red Cross in collaboration with NCDMPH, will be offered at no charge to high school students under the age of 19, thanks to the S&amp;T grant." />
